  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Edward Mulcahey (also spelt Mulcahy) is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=Bush%20Inn%20hotel">Bush Inn</ref> on the corner of Bouverie and Victoria streets in the directories from 1875 to 1880.</p>
      <p>In 1875 the Victoria Street listings give "Mulcahey, Edward" at the Bouverie Street corner, where the Bush Inn is listed in the other years.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=Bush%20Inn%20hotel">Bush Inn</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
    </body>
